---
// Footer.astro
---

<footer class="bg-pine-900 text-white border-t border-pine-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-campfire text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            ⛰️
          </div>
          <span class="font-extrabold text-xl tracking-tight text-white">
            PUNCAK RAYA OUTDOOR
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          Penyedia rental alat outdoor, tenda camping, dan perlengkapan mendaki gunung berkualitas di Yogyakarta. Bersih, steril, dan siap pakai tanpa repot hitung manual.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 font-semibold">
          ✨ Bebas biaya cuci alat kotor saat pengembalian.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Nav -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-campfire mb-3">
          Navigasi Cepat
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300">
          <li><a href="#bundling" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Paket Bundling Hemat</a></li>
          <li><a href="#katalog" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Katalog Alat Satuan</a></li>
          <li><a href="#syarat" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Ketentuan & SOP Jaminan</a></li>
          <li><a href="#basecamp" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Peta Lokasi Basecamp</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Operational -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-campfire mb-3">
          Basecamp & Jam Layanan
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-stone-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p><strong>Buka Setiap Hari:</strong> 07.30 - 22.00 WIB</p>
          <p><strong>Lokasi:</strong> Jl. Kaliurang KM 14.5, Sleman, D.I. Yogyakarta</p>
          <p><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +62 812-3456-7890</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-pine-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-400 gap-3">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Puncak Raya Outdoor Rental. Hak cipta dilindungi.</p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400">100% Free & Legal Tech Stack (Astro + Tailwind CSS + Alpine.js)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

